**/id_ed25519*
**/.netrc
**/.git-credentials
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.dockercfg
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
**/.aws
**/.gcloud
**/*.tfvars
**/.devbox
**/.envrc.local
**/build
**/.dart_tool
**/*.iml
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
.vscode/*
**/*.local*
